---
import Watch from './Watch.astro';
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
const jumps = [
  { n: 8, h: 4.4, t: 2.9, d: 21, best: true },
  { n: 11, h: 3.7, t: 2.6, d: 19 },
  { n: 5, h: 3.2, t: 2.4, d: 17 },
  { n: 2, h: 2.6, t: 2.1, d: 15 },
  { n: 10, h: 2.1, t: 1.8, d: 12 },
];
---

<section class="section" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span>How it works</p>
      <h2 id="how-title">Record. Detect. <span class="grad">Share.</span></h2>
      <p class="sub">Start the app on your wrist and ride. Everything else happens after the session.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="bento how-grid" data-stagger="1">
      <article class="card how-card" data-reveal data-spot>
        <div class="card-visual visual-watch" data-run>
          <div class="mini-watch"><Watch uid="hs" scene="story" label="Garmin watch cycling through the AIRLOG screens: start, GPS search, recording and session saved" /></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p class="step">01</p>
          <h3>Record on your wrist</h3>
          <p>AIRLOG logs GPS and raw motion sensor data on the watch while you ride. One tap to start, one to stop.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card how-card" data-reveal data-spot>
        <div class="card-visual visual-list">
          <div class="jumplist" role="table" aria-label="Demo jumps detected in a session">
            <div class="jl-head" role="row">
              <span role="columnheader">Demo · Jericoacoara</span>
              <span role="columnheader" class="jl-cols"><i>Height</i><i>Air</i><i>Dist</i></span>
            </div>
            {
              jumps.map((j, i) => (
                <div class={`jl-row${j.best ? ' is-best' : ''}`} role="row" style={`--i:${i};--w:${(j.h / 4.4) * 100}%`}>
                  <span class="jl-n" role="cell">#{j.n}</span>
                  <span class="jl-bar" role="cell" aria-hidden="true"><b></b></span>
                  <span class="jl-v" role="cell">{j.h.toFixed(1)}<small>m</small></span>
                  <span class="jl-v dim" role="cell">{j.t.toFixed(1)}<small>s</small></span>
                  <span class="jl-v dim" role="cell">{j.d}<small>m</small></span>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p class="step">02</p>
          <h3>Jumps, detected</h3>
          <p>After the session AIRLOG finds every jump in the raw data: height, airtime and distance for each one.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card how-card" data-reveal data-spot>
        <div class="card-visual visual-share">
          <div class="share-profile">
            <div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true"><Logo size={16} word={false} /></div>
            <div>
              <b>Demo Rider</b>
              <span>Public rider profile</span>
            </div>
            <span class="chip chip-demo">Demo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="share-stats">
            <div><b>4.4<small>m</small></b><span>Best jump</span></div>
            <div><b>12</b><span>Jumps today</span></div>
            <div><b>4</b><span>Spots</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="share-strava">
            <p class="ss-title">Strava description</p>
            <p><b>AIRLOG</b> · Highest jump 4.4 m · 12 jumps · Avg speed 27 km/h</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p class="step">03</p>
          <h3>Share the flight</h3>
          <p>Get a public rider profile, and soon a short AIRLOG block on every Strava activity.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import '../scripts/story.ts';
</script>
